{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Goya, a young raccoon determined to complete your village\u2019s sacred rite of passage. To prove yourself, you must face \u2014 and defeat \u2014 nine fearsome opponents in a relentless gauntlet. Will you overcome the trials and earn the right to leave your village and explore the world beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Rites is a card battler inspired by trick-taking games. It\u2019s meant to be a compact, gameplay-driven experience with very light narrative elements. I made this between 2021 and 2024 in my spare time as a fun experiment around a rarely-seen mechanic in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short length (30 to 45 minutes per game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your opponents through a card system inspired by trick-taking games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the forest's masters, each with their own fighting style and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes available: beginner and normal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, your score is saved at the end of each game: try to beat your best score and climb the leaderboard!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3829300?t=1752666242","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829300/ef5315a6e980dc1268aca25233506277c76572dc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752666242","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829300/f355147ef71e7ef566dbfb0c63b19378de3b408d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752666242","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829300/f355147ef71e7ef566dbfb0c63b19378de3b408d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752666242","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Goya, a young raccoon determined to complete your village\u2019s sacred rite of passage. To prove yourself, you must face \u2014 and defeat \u2014 nine fearsome opponents in a relentless gauntlet. Will you overcome the trials and earn the right to leave your village and explore the world beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forest Rites is a card battler inspired by trick-taking games. It\u2019s meant to be a compact, gameplay-driven experience with very light narrative elements. I made this between 2021 and 2024 in my spare time as a fun experiment around a rarely-seen mechanic in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short length (30 to 45 minutes per game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your opponents through a card system inspired by trick-taking games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the forest's masters, each with their own fighting style and strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two modes available: beginner and normal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In normal mode, your score is saved at the end of each game: try to beat your best score and climb the leaderboard!</p></li></ul>","developers":["TDL"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829300/150ca51456060f29bb62c1472bcce321822bfc78/header.jpg?t=1752666242","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[